    {
      "id": "P006",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The court's directions",
      "text": "The chair permitted de Lima's opening only under a direction to avoid conclusions of fact and law; after a defense objection invoking the earlier no-opening ruling, the chair stopped the statement and noted the continuing objection.",
