    {
      "id": "P008",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The court's directions",
      "text": "On AMLA confidentiality, the chair noted Pangilinan's manifestation and placed the cited bank-officer confidentiality provision on the record; it did not adopt Pangilinan's position as a ruling in his favor.",
      "citations": [
