    {
      "id": "P012",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The prosecution's position",
      "text": "The prosecution said it was ready to present Article 1 witnesses concerning alleged confidential-fund misuse, misappropriation, and irregular liquidation.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00013",
          "start_seconds": 423.73,
          "clock": "00:07:03",
          "speaker_name": "Rep. Gerville “Jinky Bitrics” R. Luistro"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P013",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The prosecution's position",
      "text": "In its opening, the prosecution argued that confidential funds remain subject to accountability and characterized Article 1 as involving 612.5 million pesos through the OVP and DepEd. Those were prosecution claims, not court findings.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00026",
          "start_seconds": 554.21,
          "clock": "00:09:14",
          "speaker_name": "Rep. Leila M. de Lima"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "S00042",
          "start_seconds": 808.68,
          "clock": "00:13:28",
          "speaker_name": "Rep. Leila M. de Lima"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "P014",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "The prosecution's position",
      "text": "The prosecution presented Constantino and Camposano to describe the relevant LandBank encashment processes, then requested subpoenas for additional witnesses for the following settings.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "segment_id": "S00079",
          "start_seconds": 1244.64,
          "clock": "00:20:44",
          "speaker_name": "Violeta Constantino"
        },
