    {
      "id": "P019",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Witnesses and evidence",
      "text": "Constantino described advance OVP notice, a stated 125-million-peso encashment, verification of the check and identification, and cash release to the stated payee. She said the bank had advice in its system and no cash-delivery agreement.",
