    {
      "id": "P020",
      "kind": "finding",
      "heading": "Witnesses and evidence",
      "text": "Constantino invoked AMLA confidentiality rather than disclose reporting information. She said the encashment was not illegal, described its cash nature or size as unusual to her, and also said it was supported by advice and funding.",
